@startuml architecture
title @naskot/node-hmac-auth-management - Component overview

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

package "Consumer App (NestJS / Express / Nuxt / framework-agnostic)" as App {
  component "Cron / route / loop\n(consumer-driven sync trigger)" as Trigger
  component "Admin endpoints\n(add / update / remove)" as Admin
  database "BDD\n(any storage: SQL, Mongo,\nin-memory, REST proxy)" as Bdd
  component "ManagedCrud impl\n(consumer-supplied)" as Crud
}

package "@naskot/node-hmac-auth-management" as Lib {
  component "core/types + core/errors\n(ManagedRow, ManagedCrud,\nSyncSummary, TargetHealth,\nHmacAuthMgmtError)" as Types
  component "core/derive\n(deriveSecretV1 - FROZEN)" as Derive
  component "management/init\n(createHmacAuthManagement)" as Init
  component "management/auto-seed\n(propagation-key row at boot)" as AutoSeed
  component "management/track\n(9-method per-track surface)" as Track
  component "management/sync\n(Phase A/B/C/D orchestrator)" as Sync
  component "management/push\n(per-target push + retry swap\n+ delete + revert)" as Push
  component "management/health\n(probe + bootstrapLocked)" as Health
  component "state/propagation-key-cache\n(1 read per boot)" as Cache
}

package "@naskot/node-hmac-auth (>=1.3.0, peerDep)" as Upstream {
  component "initializeHmacHttpAuth\n+ clients CRUD\n+ propagateClientToApis\n+ createHttpSignedFetchClient" as HttpInit
  component "initializeHmacMessageAuth\n+ clients CRUD" as MsgInit
}

database "Source local Redis\n(via upstream lib)" as RedisSource

cloud "Federation of targets\n(any v1.3.0+ API)" as Targets

' --- consumer wiring ---
Trigger --> Track : mgmt.http.sync()
Admin --> Track : mgmt.http.add() / update() / remove()
Track --> Crud : read + write
Crud --> Bdd : SQL / NoSQL / REST

' --- internal wiring ---
Init --> AutoSeed : await runAutoSeed() at boot
Init --> Track : createTrack(...) per declared track
Init --> Cache : createPropagationKeyCache(...)
AutoSeed --> Derive : deriveSecretV1(secretToken, propagationKey)
AutoSeed --> Crud : create propagation-key row when missing
Track --> Sync : delegates sync() call
Sync --> Cache : read propagation-key row
Sync --> Health : probeTarget(target)
Sync --> Push : pushRowToTarget / deleteRowOnTarget / revertRowOnTarget
Sync --> Crud : setDeliveryState + update row status

' --- upstream wiring ---
Sync --> HttpInit : propagateClientToApis\n(signed by propagation key)
Sync --> HttpInit : clients.setSecretHash\n+ clients.revert + clients.delete
Sync --> MsgInit : same surface for message track\n(targetStore: "message" on the wire)
HttpInit --> RedisSource : credential CRUD
HttpInit ..> Targets : signed HTTP propagation\n(POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE\n/api/internal/hmac)

note bottom of Sync
  Phase A: probe + bootstrap propagation key
           (per-target, detects Trap 4 target reset)
  Phase B: clear propagation-key plain after first push
  Phase C: data-plane rows, atomic with rollback
           (DELETE for create, PATCH revert for update)
  Phase D: delete_pending, best-effort
end note

note right of Track
  Public surface (9 methods):
  add / update / remove ........ BDD-only writes
  sync ......................... worker (only thing
                                 touching Redis + net)
  get / list ................... read-only
  health / healthAll ........... probe
  getDeliveryStatus ............ per-(row, target) cursor

  add/update/remove on the
  propagation-key clientId
  throw PROPAGATION_KEY_REMOVE_FORBIDDEN.
end note

@enduml
